<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<span id="docs-internal-guid-3308dfb3-b3da-dded-cf95-e3753fdc3572"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Contact.FirstName},</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Thank you for your interest in the graduate certificate in instructional design and performance improvement at ASU’s Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College. This program focuses on how to facilitate learning and improve performance in a variety of settings, including design and development of instruction, instructional media design, development of computer-based instruction and trends in performance improvement.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">My name is </span><a href="mailto:donna.parris@asu.edu" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Donna Parris</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">, and I am here to answer any questions you have about the program and to assist you during the application process. To get the most up-to-date program information, attend one of our upcoming information sessions. We offer both on-campus and online sessions for your convenience, some of which include faculty participation. </span><a href="http://education.asu.edu/resources/events" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Register now</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> to reserve your spot for an information session as soon as possible. Please also take a look at the </span><a href="https://education.asu.edu/sites/default/files/Instructional-Design%20-Performance-Improvement-Program-Guide_0.pdf" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">program guide</span></a><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> for specifics on program requirements, the application process and funding information.</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">My primary goal is to provide you with the support and resources you will need in pursuing your graduate education. Here are a few more links I think will be helpful for you:</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="http://education.asu.edu/graduate-programs-how-apply" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College Programs: How to Apply</span></a></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="http://education.asu.edu/resources/scholarships" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College Scholarship Information</span></a></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate?destination=node/16972" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">ASU Graduate Admissions Services</span></a></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/apply" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Applying to Graduate Studies</span></a></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/standards" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Admission Standards</span></a></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/graduate/finances" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Financing Your Graduate Education</span></a></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><a href="https://students.asu.edu/tuition" style="text-decoration:none;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(17, 85, 204); text-decoration: underline; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Tuition and Fees / Tuition Estimator</span></a></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">If you have any questions regarding the application process, please contact me and I will be happy to work with you or connect you with other university resources. &nbsp;</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">I hope to see or hear from you soon!</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> </span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Kindest regards,</span></p><br><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Donna Parris</span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Student Outreach Coordinator &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">		</span></span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(99, 36, 35); font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Arizona State University</span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(31, 73, 125); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> | </span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(254, 194, 0); font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">Mary Lou Fulton Teachers College</span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(31, 73, 125); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(31, 73, 125); vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre;">	</span></span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.15;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">donna.parris@asu.edu</span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; color: rgb(0, 0, 124); font-weight: bold; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class="Apple-tab-span" style="white-space:pre">					</span></span><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">480-727-1745 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><div><span style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></div></span>]]></td>
